<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'><text y=".9em" font-size='90'>🛠</text></svg>">
<title>SpeedRead - 隐私政策</title>
<style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#c9d1d9;background:#0d1117;max-width:800px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 20px;line-height:1.8}h1{color:#58a6ff;margin-bottom:24px}h2{color:#f0f6fc;margin-top:32px;margin-bottom:12px}p{margin-bottom:12px}a{color:#58a6ff}footer{margin-top:40px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #30363d;font-size:13px;color:#8b949e}*:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #58a6ff;outline-offset:2px}::selection{background:rgba(88,166,255,0.3);color:#fff}</style></head>
<body><h1>⚡ SpeedRead 隐私政策</h1><p><strong>2026年6月4日</strong></p><h2>数据</h2><p>SpeedRead 不收集任何用户数据。选中的文字仅在本地设备上处理后即丢弃。</p><h2>权限</h2><ul><li><strong>activeTab</strong>：读取当前页面选中文字</li><li><strong>storage</strong>：保存速度设置</li></ul><h2>联系</h2><p>tulv202900@163.com</p><footer><p>SpeedRead © 2026</p></footer></body></html>
